cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "road-speed-audit: camera-based vehicle speed measurement on one road segment, validated on synthetic ground truth"
abstract: >-
  An offline, privacy-preserving tool that measures vehicle speeds on one road
  segment from a fixed camera (homography calibration, background-subtraction
  detection, a SORT/ByteTrack-style tracker, robust speed fitting with
  Monte-Carlo uncertainty) and reports municipal speed statistics. Accuracy is
  characterised on simulated video with exact ground truth; no field validation
  has been carried out yet.
type: software
authors:
